    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The State is in appeal to challenge the High Court judgment whereby the conviction of the respondent, who is the mother-in-law of the deceased was converted from Section 302 read with Section 34 of the Indian Penal Code(IPC)) to conviction Under Section 498A and 201 of the IPC.",
